Spec: Settings

Purpose:
  Settings tab: default activity, language, appearance and the countdown cue.

Owns:
  ./*.dart
  ./widgets/*.dart
  /test/settings

References:
  /docs/specs/history/14-settings-profile.md
  /docs/specs/history/21-countdown-cue.md

Must:
  Language is system, English or German, stored as `app_language` and applied in-app at once.
  Appearance is system, light or dark.
  The default activity is picked from a grid of activity tiles.
  Count down out loud is on by default; off means no voice and no vibration.
  The screen reads the live providers; @SettingsController only writes.
